            "title": "Question: Plus operator",
            "id": 82963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode apa yang kita gunakan untuk menggabungkan list satu demi satu menjadi satu list yang lebih besar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>sum()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada kode seperti itu</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>count()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Plus operator",
            "id": 82964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gabungkan kedua list tabungan triwulanan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"savings_1 = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings_2 = [\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(savings_1 + savings_2)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"87\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[100, 20, 70, 50, 0, 200, 10, 40]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>savings_1 + savings_2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Appended at the end",
            "id": 82965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa perbedaan antara pernyataan display pertama dan kedua?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prefix = [\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number = [\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(prefix + number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(number + prefix)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[0, 0, 4, 5, 5, 5, 3, 7, 0, 1]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[5, 5, 3, 7, 0, 1, 0, 0, 4, 5]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pada yang pertama, list <code>prefix</code> ditampilkan terlebih dahulu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pada yang pertama, list <code>number</code> ditampilkan lebih dahulu</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada perbedaan antara pernyataan display</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Angka-angka diacak secara acak pada yang kedua</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pada yang pertama, list <code>prefix</code> ditampilkan terlebih dahulu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Appended at the end",
            "id": 82966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gabungkan list sehingga elemen <code>customers</code> muncul lebih dulu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_numbers = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"orders = customers + order_numbers\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"98\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>customers + order_numbers</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Different types",
            "id": 82967,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"student_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"group = student_1 + student_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(group)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Anna', 16, 'Joe', 17]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>['Anna', 16, 'Joe', 17]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['Anna', 'Joe', 16, 17]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada, kita tidak bisa menggabungkan list dengan tipe campuran</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>['Joe', 17, 'Anna', 16]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>['Anna', 16, 'Joe', 17]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Different types",
            "id": 82968,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gabungkan list <code>movies</code> dengan list <code>tickets_sold</code> sehingga nilai string berada di awal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Casablanca&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;The Shining&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tickets_sold = [\" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(movies + tickets_sold)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"91\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Casablanca', 'The Shining', 57, 48]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>movies + tickets_sold</code>.</p></body></html>"
